          "min_libbridgething_version": "0.17.0",
          "changelog": "First release: play bootleg Composer (0.5.0 or later) from the Car Thing.\n\n- Pads: hitting near the top of a pad plays louder.\n- Two octaves of keys that bend as a held finger slides sideways.\n- Waves drawn with a finger, which become a looping sample and a riff in Composer.\n- Record into the looping riff, select riffs, loop, play and stop.\n- A Loop page for Composer's live looper on the Mac's input: record and overdub on the big button or the knob click,\n  a ping-pong delay with tempo-synced times, feedback and mix, plus undo, clear and keep.\n- Presets 1-4 pick the four pages.\n- The knob bends held notes. With nothing held it sets the delay feedback on the Loop page, and scrubs the song\n  elsewhere."
